Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.20,TitleCard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Peace and Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:08.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:16.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Oh oh oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}窗外城市的喧囂與繁華
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.60,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}遮蔽了心中溫暖的陽光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們在人海加快了步伐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.90,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}卻忘了當初純真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}直到這一刻我才終於懂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:38.60,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}平靜的力量藏在心最深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}讓世界轉動 靈魂更清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:44.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}這份愛才能溫暖你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:49.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}和平在心裡 像一座燈塔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:54.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}指引著迷途靈魂找到家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:59.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}愛是道光芒 溫柔且偉大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:04.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}融化了世間所有的冰霜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:08.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}擁抱這份愛 我們不孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:10.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}手牽手走過風雨和黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:13.60,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}讓這份平靜 永遠留心房
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:16.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love 是唯一的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:19.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}看著時鐘滴答轉 腳步不停在追趕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:22.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}滑著滿屏的喧鬧 到底誰能給答案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:24.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們築起了高牆 以為這樣才安全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:27.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}卻把最在乎的人 擋在心門的外面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:30.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}深呼吸一口氣 把防備卸下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.60,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}少一點偏見 就多一點體諒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:35.30,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}寬容不是認輸 是給自己一條路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:38.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}當你張開了雙手 才能擁抱住幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:41.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}直到這一刻我才終於懂
